		{"id":"tool","type":"text","text":"scripts/wiki_tool.py\n\n• hybrid-search\n• build-note\n• lint-evidence\n• export-wiki-index\n• terrain-gap-lint\n• cross-community-gap-lint\n\nNo recrawl. No raw source mutation.","x":2240,"y":-580,"width":330,"height":260,"color":"6"},
		{"id":"review","type":"text","text":"Review / Growth Loop\n\nZine failures, terrain gaps, lint warnings, and user repair reports should become Review artifacts first. Only reviewed material should become stronger compiled Wiki notes.\n\nQuestion Pet growth signals should come from evidence_found, gap_detected, lint_resolved, and terrain_promoted states.","x":2240,"y":-270,"width":700,"height":230,"color":"5"},
